((= Jinja2 template turning the YAML content + style into a LaTeX document. =))
((=                                                                         =))
((= Delimiters are LaTeX friendly: statements are wrapped in round-bracket  =))
((= plus asterisk pairs, expressions in triple round brackets and comments  =))
((= in round-bracket plus equals-sign pairs - see the markup below.         =))
((=                                                                         =))
((= Available context: style, content, header, sections, labels, lang.      =))
((= The tex filter escapes LaTeX special characters.                        =))
